<div class="aboutus-banner">
  <%= image_tag 'page-header-about-us.jpg', class: 'img-fluid' %>
  <div class="caption d-flex justify-content-center flex-column">
    <div class="container-fluid page__container">
      <ul class="list-unstyled p-0 mb-1">
        <li class="d-inline-block"><%= link_to "Home", root_path, class: 'text-white' %></li>
        <li class="d-inline-block mx-1 text-white">></li>
        <li class="d-inline-block"><%= link_to "Overview", '#', class: 'text-white' %></li>
      </ul>
      <h1 class="text-white mb-2">Organization Dashboard Overview</h1>
      <p class="text-white text-light">A hub for E-Learning Organizations!</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="four-section">
  <div class="align-items-center order-change">
    <h1 class="bold">Organization Complete Dashboard Overview</h1>
    <h5>All the amazing features available on the organization dashboard!</h5>
    <div class="row">
      <div class="col-lg-6 col-xl-6 p-0">
        <div class="p-3 px-5 h-100 aos-init aos-animate" data-aos="fade-right" data-offset="-100">
          <p class="text-justify">On the dashboard screen, the organization owner can view various numbers
          and statistics like the total number of students who have enrolled in different
          courses in the present month, total instructors of the organization, and the
          total earnings of the current month and year.</p>
          <p class="text-justify">Here is the complete list of features that are available for the Organization.</p>
          <ul align="left">
            <li><strong>On-board Instructors</strong></li>
            <li><strong>On-board Students</strong></li>
            <li><strong>Offer Courses</strong></li>
            <li><strong>Manage Payments</strong></li>
            <li><strong>Schedule Events</strong></li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="col-lg-6 col-xl-6 p-0 box" style="min-height: 300px; position: relative; overflow: hidden;">
        <div class="parallax">
          <%= image_tag("overview-banners/organizer-dashboard.jpg") %>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<%= render 'shared/public_partials/register' %>

<div class="four-section">
  <div class="align-items-center">
    <h3 class="bold">Instructors</h3>
    <h5>Manage Instructor Profiles</h5>
    <div class="row">
      <div class="col-lg-6 col-xl-6 p-0">
        <div class="p-3 px-5 h-100 aos-init aos-animate" data-aos="fade-right" data-offset="-100">
          <p class="text-justify">The organization owners can view the list of all the instructors within the
          organization and can also create, edit, and delete their profiles.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="col-lg-6 col-xl-6 p-0 box" style="min-height: 300px; position: relative; overflow: hidden;">
        <div class="parallax">
          <%= image_tag("overview-banners/organizer-instructor.jpg") %>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="align-items-center order-change">
    <h3 class="bold">Students</h3>
    <h5>Manage Student Profiles</h5>
    <div class="row">
      <div class="col-lg-6 col-xl-6 p-0 box" style="min-height: 300px; position: relative; overflow: hidden;">
        <div class="parallax">
          <%= image_tag("overview-banners/organizer-student.jpg") %>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="col-lg-6 col-xl-6 p-0">
        <div class="p-3 px-5 h-100 aos-init aos-animate" data-aos="fade-left" data-offset="-100">
          <p class="text-justify">A list of enrolled students is shown on this screen. The organization owners
          can also edit these profiles and can add new ones.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="align-items-center">
    <h3 class="bold">Batch</h3>
    <h5>Manage Batches and Sessions</h5>
    <div class="row">
      <div class="col-lg-6 col-xl-6 p-0">
        <div class="p-3 px-5 h-100 aos-init aos-animate" data-aos="fade-right" data-offset="-100">
          <p class="text-justify">All the information related to the batches/sessions is displayed on this
          screen. The organization owner can view the data and also can update it
          easily.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="col-lg-6 col-xl-6 p-0 box" style="min-height: 300px; position: relative; overflow: hidden;">
        <div class="parallax">
          <%= image_tag("overview-banners/organizer-batches.jpg") %>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="align-items-center order-change">
    <h3 class="bold">Courses</h3>
    <h5>Manage Your Courses</h5>
    <div class="row">
      <div class="col-lg-6 col-xl-6 p-0 box" style="min-height: 300px; position: relative; overflow: hidden;">
        <div class="parallax">
          <%= image_tag("overview-banners/organizer-courses.jpg") %>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="col-lg-6 col-xl-6 p-0">
        <div class="p-3 px-5 h-100 aos-init aos-animate" data-aos="fade-left" data-offset="-100">
          <p class="text-justify">All the courses offered by the organization are listed on this screen and the
          organization owners can edit these courses, add new ones, and can delete
          old ones as well.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="align-items-center">
    <h3 class="bold">Billing</h3>
    <h5>Track Financial Details of Your Organization</h5>
    <div class="row">
      <div class="col-lg-6 col-xl-6 p-0">
        <div class="p-3 px-5 h-100 aos-init aos-animate" data-aos="fade-right" data-offset="-100">
          <p class="text-justify">The organization owners can manage the financial details of their
          organization. They can very easily track the wages of their staff while
          managing the student fees as well.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="col-lg-6 col-xl-6 p-0 box" style="min-height: 300px; position: relative; overflow: hidden;">
        <div class="parallax">
          <%= image_tag("overview-banners/organizer-billing.jpg") %>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="align-items-center order-change">
    <h3 class="bold">Payment History</h3>
    <h5>Monitor Monthly Subscription Details</h5>
    <div class="row">
      <div class="col-lg-6 col-xl-6 p-0 box" style="min-height: 300px; position: relative; overflow: hidden;">
        <div class="parallax">
          <%= image_tag("overview-banners/organizer-payments-history.jpg") %>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="col-lg-6 col-xl-6 p-0">
        <div class="p-3 px-5 h-100 aos-init aos-animate" data-aos="fade-left" data-offset="-100">
          <p class="text-justify">This section will display the monthly subscription payment history between
          Brighter’s Room and the Organization. All the relevant details will be
          available to the organization owner which will ensure complete transparency.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="align-items-center">
    <h3 class="bold">Pricing Plans</h3>
    <h5>Choose Pricing Plans</h5>
    <div class="row">
      <div class="col-lg-6 col-xl-6 p-0">
        <div class="p-3 px-5 h-100 aos-init aos-animate" data-aos="fade-right" data-offset="-100">
          <p class="text-justify">This will show the pricing plan that the organization is subscribed to. The
          other available pricing plans will also be displayed so that the organization
          owner can upgrade or downgrade their plan based on their needs.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="col-lg-6 col-xl-6 p-0 box" style="min-height: 300px; position: relative; overflow: hidden;">
        <div class="parallax">
          <%= image_tag("overview-banners/organizer-pricing-plans.jpg") %>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="align-items-center order-change">
    <h3 class="bold">Event Calendar</h3>
    <h5>Create and Manage Events</h5>
    <div class="row">
      <div class="col-lg-6 col-xl-6 p-0 box" style="min-height: 300px; position: relative; overflow: hidden;">
        <div class="parallax">
          <%= image_tag("overview-banners/organizer-events.jpg") %>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="col-lg-6 col-xl-6 p-0">
        <div class="p-3 px-5 h-100 aos-init aos-animate" data-aos="fade-left" data-offset="-100">
          <p class="text-justify">The organization owner can mark various events like New Batch Enrollment,
          Exam Week, etc. on a calendar. The event will be broadcasted and all the
          users will receive a notification. The users will also be able to view the event
          on their own calendars</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="align-items-center">
    <h3 class="bold">Newsletter</h3>
    <h5>Send Memos to Staff & Students</h5>
    <div class="row">
      <div class="col-lg-6 col-xl-6 p-0">
        <div class="p-3 px-5 h-100 aos-init aos-animate" data-aos="fade-right" data-offset="-100">
          <p class="text-justify">The organization owner has the ability to send out memos to Instructors
          and/or Students.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="col-lg-6 col-xl-6 p-0 box" style="min-height: 300px; position: relative; overflow: hidden;">
        <div class="parallax">
          <%= image_tag("overview-banners/organizer-newsletters.jpg") %>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
